{
	"_readme": "Settings for the relay (see Relay/README.md). Provider and company names live only here and in wrangler secrets, never in text the game shows. A provider serves calls only when its secret is set and its models list is not empty. Models and endpoints were checked against each provider's own docs on 2026-11-14 (see Relay/README.md); T16 may change the picks. Limits can be overridden per deploy or in wrangler dev with the vars SESSION_CALLS, IP_DAILY_CALLS, DAILY_CALLS and DAILY_TOKENS (DAILY_TOKENS applies to every provider).",
	"max_body_bytes": 65536,
	"upstream_timeout_ms": 90000,
	"limits": {
		"_readme": "A show is about 55 calls of 1,300 to 5,400 input tokens each (Findings in Docs/MVPPlan.md). The day is the UTC day. session_calls is per session id per day, ip_daily_calls per player address per day, daily_calls for everyone together.",
		"session_calls": 150,
		"ip_daily_calls": 600,
		"daily_calls": 5000
	},
